OL,4,G1600FEmily Pilbeam
OL,5,     GIt's Friday, so Emily is out to
OL,6,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,7,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music today
OL,8,     G- so let us know what you want to
OL,9,     Ghear.
OL,10,G1900FThe People's Party with Femi
OL,11,     FKoleoso
OL,12,     GThe London jungle production duo
OL,13,     Gshare their Friday night tracks
OL,14,     Gand stories in the wake of their
OL,15,     Gnew EP, Love On The Line with
OL,16,     Gcollaborator Layla Sibelle.
